{"id":"old-iranian-1357001","title":"The South's Shark","imdbCode":"old-iranian-1357001","imdbUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt1112711/","source":"old-iranian-archive","sourceName":"Old Iranian Film Archive","sourcePageUrl":"https://oldfarsi.blogspot.com/search/label/%DA%A9%D9%88%D8%B3%D9%87%20%D8%AC%D9%86%D9%88%D8%A8","sourceUrls":["https://oldfarsi.blogspot.com/search/label/%DA%A9%D9%88%D8%B3%D9%87%20%D8%AC%D9%86%D9%88%D8%A8","https://oldfarsi.blogspot.com/search?q=%DA%A9%D9%88%D8%B3%D9%87%20%D8%AC%D9%86%D9%88%D8%A8"],"type":"movie","year":1978,"persianYear":1357,"releaseDate":"1978-01-01","originalTitle":"Koose-ye jonoob","imdbVotes":81,"imdbRating":6.1,"groups":["Old Iranian Films"],"qualities":[],"links":[],"genres":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"persianGenres":["فیلم درام","فیلم مهیج","فیلم جنایی"],"countries":["Iran"],"persianCountries":["ایران"],"languages":["Persian"],"persianLanguages":["فارسی"],"overview":"Akbar, Nader, Abbas and Reza, who have been good friends since childhood, all want to achieve an aspiration. Abbas and Nader are wearing uniforms, Akbar joins his uncle's smuggling gang and Reza, who is paralyzed, does not wish for anything other than to continue his friendship with the other three. Reza's sister Masoumeh and Akbar have been interested in each other since they were children. Akbar gains credibility among the members of the smuggling group and gets the nickname Shark. While transporting a satchel of smuggled goods Akbar kills a gendarme and goes to Abbas's house wounded. Abbas turns him over to the police and he is sentenced to death in court. Masoumeh visits Akbar and becomes engaged to him. Before the execution she asks that Nader serve as one of the excecutioners.","persianOverview":"فیلم ایرانی به کارگردانی ساموئل خاچیکیان ۱۳۵۶","tagline":null,"runtimeMinutes":108,"posterUrl":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BYjM5OThhY2EtN2UxZi00YzNhLThiY2MtMTQ4MWM3MWMyYjQzXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://m.media-amazon.com/image